CGDD-Net

This implementation follows and reworks the training/data/evaluation workflow of
VesselSeg-Pytorch by lee-zq:
https://github.com/lee-zq/VesselSeg-Pytorch
The supplied upstream project is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0;
a copy is included in LICENSE.

Changes in this release: CGDD-Net architecture matching the supplied manuscript
diagrams, explicit split manifests, image/subject leakage checks, normalized
inputs, masked binary cross entropy, linear warmup and cosine restarts, portable
run configuration, checkpoint/resume support, and reproducibility utilities.

The upstream retinal image datasets are not included and are not licensed by
this software license. Obtain them from their original providers.
The manuscript's reported benchmark scores are author-supplied results, not
measurements produced by the repository's synthetic smoke tests.
